@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
hide footbox
autonumber
title 初始版本：管理员审批待审核报名

actor "管理员" as Admin
participant "活动管理页" as UI
participant "RegistrationService" as Service
participant "ActivityRepository" as ActivityRepo
participant "RegistrationRepository" as RegRepo
participant "EventBus" as Bus
participant "SiteMessageHandler" as Handler
database "SQLite" as DB

Admin -> UI : 点击“批准”
UI -> Service : approve(registrationId)

Service -> RegRepo : get(registrationId)
RegRepo --> Service : Registration
Service -> Service : 校验状态必须为 PENDING
Service -> ActivityRepo : get(activityId, includeDeleted=true)
ActivityRepo --> Service : Activity
Service -> RegRepo : count(activityId, APPROVED)
RegRepo --> Service : approvedCount

alt 活动已下架 / 名额已满
  Service --> UI : BusinessError("不能批准")
  UI --> Admin : 显示失败原因
else 状态合法且有名额
  Service -> RegRepo : updateStatus(APPROVED)
  RegRepo -> DB : UPDATE registration
  Service -> Service : 事务提交
  Service -> Bus : publish(RegistrationApproved)
  Bus -> Bus : reserve(eventId)
  Bus -> Handler : handle(event)
  Handler -> DB : INSERT message
  Service --> UI : Registration(APPROVED)
  UI --> Admin : 显示成功
end

note over Service, Handler
  通知处理器抛异常时：
  回滚该处理器未提交的写入，
  记录 notification_failures；
  已提交的报名状态不受影响。
end note
@enduml

